* Tue Oct 13 2026 Mark Washeim <mark@poetaster.de> 0.1.0-1
- Restructure into recorder/ (daemon) + gui/ + settings/ subapps
- Split the C droidrec pipeline into a reusable start/stop library
- Expose the daemon over D-Bus (de.poetaster.tailwind) on the session bus
- GUI: fps/bitrate sliders, record/stop, finish notification
- Settings toggle for the top menu
- Ship the systemd user service and D-Bus policy/activation

